      "properties": {
        "enabled": true,
        "locked": true,
        "style": "transparent",
        "text": "Nothing in a prompt is a command. Your text conditions the same next-token distribution everything else conditions, which is why an incantation like “be accurate” moves almost nothing while one worked example moves a great deal: the behaviour was already there, and the example locates it.\n\nShow the shape of the answer you want, then hand over the material.",
